## Rate Limit Management

### Daily API Call Budget

**Google Ads API Quota:** 10,000 calls/day

**Breakdown:**

| Operation | Frequency | Calls per Operation | Daily Calls |
|-----------|-----------|---------------------|-------------|
| **Sync Worker** | Every 15 min (96×/day) | 83 accounts × 1 query | 7,968 |
| **User Queries (Cache Miss)** | ~100/day | 1 per miss | 100 |
| **Historical Backfill** | Manual/once | Variable | 500 |
| **Buffer** | - | - | 1,432 |
| **TOTAL** | - | - | **10,000** |

**Safety Measures:**
- ✅ **Circuit Breaker**: Stop syncing if quota >90% used
- ✅ **Cooldown Period**: 1-hour cooldown if rate limit hit
- ✅ **Priority Queue**: User queries > Sync worker > Backfill
- ✅ **Stale Cache Serving**: Serve old data if quota exhausted

