### Phase 3: Testing (Day 4)

**Test Scenarios:**

| Test Case | Expected Result | Pass Criteria |
|-----------|----------------|---------------|
| **Sync worker runs successfully** | All accounts synced | >95% success rate |
| **Redis cache hit for today** | Data from cache | <100ms load time |
| **MongoDB query for last month** | Data from DB | <500ms load time |
| **API fallback for old data** | Data fetched & saved | Saved to MongoDB |
| **Data consistency check** | Totals match | <$0.01 difference |
| **Rate limit handling** | Serves stale data | No errors |
| **Worker stays alive 24 hours** | No crashes | 96+ sync cycles |

