### Phase 4: Render Deployment (Day 5)

**Render Configuration:**

**1. Background Worker (Sync Worker):**
```yaml
# render.yaml
services:
  - type: worker
    name: mongodb-sync-worker
    env: node
    buildCommand: npm install
    startCommand: node scripts/mongodb-sync-worker.js
    healthCheckPath: /health
    envVars:
      - key: MONGODB_URI
        sync: false
      - key: CRON_SECRET
        sync: false
      - key: NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL
        value: https://adsynthex.onrender.com
      # ... all other env vars
```

**2. Web Service (Next.js):**
```yaml
  - type: web
    name: adsynthex-web
    env: node
    buildCommand: npm install && npm run build
    startCommand: npm start
    envVars:
      - key: MONGODB_URI
        sync: false
      # ... same env vars
```

**Environment Variables Required:**
```bash
# MongoDB
MONGODB_URI=mongodb+srv://user:pass@cluster.mongodb.net/adsynthex

# Redis
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=https://...
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=...

# Google Ads API
GOOGLE_ADS_CLIENT_ID=...
GOOGLE_ADS_CLIENT_SECRET=...
GOOGLE_ADS_DEVELOPER_TOKEN=...
GOOGLE_ADS_MANAGER_ID=...
GOOGLE_ADS_REFRESH_TOKEN=...

# Revenue APIs
ADSENSE_REFRESH_TOKEN=...
COMPADO_API_USER=...
COMPADO_API_PASSWORD=...
ADSCOM_API_KEY=...

# App Config
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://adsynthex.onrender.com
CRON_SECRET=your_secret_key
NODE_ENV=production
```

