## Success Metrics

### Performance KPIs

| Metric | Target | Current (Redis-only) | Expected Improvement |
|--------|--------|----------------------|----------------------|
| **Dashboard Load Time (Today)** | <200ms | 50-100ms ✅ | No change |
| **Historical Query (Last Month)** | <1s | 30-60s ❌ | **60× faster** |
| **Cache Hit Rate** | >80% | 40-50% | **2× better** |
| **Data Consistency** | 100% | 70-80% ❌ | **100%** ✅ |
| **API Calls per Day** | <8,000 | ~10,000 ⚠️ | **20% reduction** |
| **Worker Uptime** | >99.5% | 85% ❌ | **99.9%** ✅ |

### Data Quality KPIs

| Metric | Target | Validation Method |
|--------|--------|-------------------|
| **Sync Success Rate** | >98% | Check sync_status collection |
| **Data Completeness** | >99% | Compare API vs MongoDB record count |
| **Duplicate Records** | 0% | Unique index violations |
| **Stale Data (>1 hour old)** | <2% | Query updated_at timestamps |

