## Rollback Plan

If deployment fails or causes issues:

### Immediate Rollback (5 minutes)

1. ✅ Disable MongoDB sync worker on Render
2. ✅ Revert API routes to Redis-only version
3. ✅ Redeploy previous git commit
4. ✅ Verify Redis cache is working

### Gradual Rollback (1 hour)

1. ✅ Keep MongoDB syncing but don't query it
2. ✅ Monitor MongoDB for data quality issues
3. ✅ Fix issues offline
4. ✅ Re-enable MongoDB queries when stable

