## Maintenance & Monitoring

### Daily Monitoring

**Automated Alerts:**
- ❌ Sync worker down for >30 minutes
- ❌ Sync success rate <90%
- ❌ API quota usage >90%
- ❌ MongoDB storage >80% full
- ❌ Data consistency check fails

**Dashboard Metrics:**
- Total records in MongoDB
- Sync success rate (last 24 hours)
- Cache hit rates (Redis vs MongoDB)
- API call budget remaining
- Average query response times

### Weekly Maintenance

**Tasks:**
1. Review sync error logs
2. Check MongoDB index usage
3. Verify data consistency across all feeds
4. Clean up old Redis cache entries
5. Review API quota usage trends

### Monthly Maintenance

**Tasks:**
1. Archive old data (>90 days) to aggregated snapshots
2. Optimize MongoDB indexes based on query patterns
3. Review and adjust cache TTLs
4. Update rate limit thresholds if needed
5. Performance audit and optimization

