## Open Questions & Risks

### Technical Risks

| Risk | Impact | Probability | Mitigation |
|------|--------|-------------|------------|
| **MongoDB connection pool exhaustion** | High | Medium | Implement connection pooling with limits |
| **Sync worker timeout on large datasets** | Medium | Low | Batch processing, skip if taking >8 min |
| **Data inconsistency during migration** | High | Medium | Incremental migration, validate each step |
| **Redis cache invalidation issues** | Medium | Low | Explicit cache clearing after MongoDB writes |

### Business Risks

| Risk | Impact | Probability | Mitigation |
|------|--------|-------------|------------|
| **Increased costs** | Low | High | Monitor usage, optimize if needed |
| **Migration downtime** | Medium | Low | Deploy during low-traffic hours |
| **User confusion with load times** | Low | Medium | Add loading indicators |

