### B. Sample Queries

**Get today's total revenue for AFS:**
```javascript
db.afs_revenue.aggregate([
  { $match: { date: '2025-11-21', feed_type: 'afs' } },
  { $group: { _id: null, total: { $sum: '$revenue_usd' } } }
])
```

**Get last 30 days cost by account:**
```javascript
db.afs_cost.aggregate([
  { $match: {
      date: { $gte: '2025-10-22', $lte: '2025-11-21' },
      feed_type: 'afs'
    }
  },
  { $group: {
      _id: '$account_id',
      total_cost: { $sum: '$cost_micros' },
      total_clicks: { $sum: '$clicks' }
    }
  },
  { $sort: { total_cost: -1 } }
])
```

